        "genre": "Hip-Hop"
      },
      "editorial": {
        "en": {
          "shortSummary": "Missy Elliott performs through rain, reflective surfaces, fisheye distortion, dancers, and an inflated black suit that radically changes her silhouette.",
          "whyItMatters": "The video established an image of female rap performance grounded in scale, humor, bodily autonomy, and futurism rather than inherited conventions of presentation.",
          "historicalContext": "Released in 1997, it was the first collaboration between Elliott and Hype Williams and introduced the visual language surrounding her debut album.",
          "keyInnovation": "Extreme wide-angle optics, direct-to-camera performance, sculptural styling, and exaggerated spatial depth make the artist's body the source of the frame's visual logic."
        },
        "ja": {
          "shortSummary": "Missy Elliottが雨、反射面、魚眼の歪み、ダンサー、身体の輪郭を大きく変える黒い膨張スーツの中で演じる作品。",
          "whyItMatters": "女性ラップの演技イメージを、既存の提示慣習ではなく、縮尺、ユーモア、身体の主体性、未来性に基づいて確立しました。",
          "historicalContext": "1997年に公開され、ElliottとHype Williamsの最初の協働となり、デビューアルバムを取り巻く視覚言語を提示しました。",
          "keyInnovation": "極端な広角光学、カメラへの直接的な演技、彫刻的なスタイリング、誇張された奥行きによって、アーティストの身体を画面構造の起点にしています。"
        }
      },
